To report software bugs in MACHXL, use the following procedure:


   1)  Complete the electronic form FORM.SPR found in the MACHXL
       root directory.

   2)  Attach a copy of your design.PDS and design.LOG file to the
       end of the form.
 
------------------------------------------------------------------

To Submit Problems
==================

Unix with INTERNET connection: mail to

